title Caravan dispute -- a reader who answers something other than agreement is recorded
prompt Keaton set the loop running: read Kyri and Radiant Style first, then REMEMBER, the itineraries, and the newest logs, close any open agent-closable red, then take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first and send it.
think Standfast first. The reds ledger reads 97 rows with %96 and %97 both CLOSED and rows 88-95 folded to the archive; no open agent-closable red stands, so the constructive queue is free.
think The running thread is the Caravan correction arc. The newest log's recommend named the next question plainly: a plan owes something to a reader who answers something other than agreement, since hear refuses that hand and stays entirely silent about what the reader meant.
think Named the rung dispute under the Comlink tendency -- clear, fun, safe. Grepped dispute, demur, dissent, contest, object across the tree; dispute is free and the plainest of them.
think Council rota this lap: foundations/20260811-233509_the-singularity.md, index taken as the choir count 62 mod 27. Its line held for this rung -- the tool that can build itself is trustworthy only because it can also catch itself, which is what a record holding a disagreement it cannot resolve is for.
think The design fork: hear ends the run on a disagreeing hand. Rather than retire that refusal, this rung hands the hearing a stricter question -- an answer counts as heard only where the hand agrees -- so a disagreeing hand leaves the hearing exactly where it stood and this rung decides what the record keeps.
think Four refusals by name, each about the record rather than the answer: DisputeEarly the moment, DisputeUnheard the supply, DisputeMiscounted the honesty of the count, DisputeUnfounded the record.
think Proved five RED paths on metal before any GREEN claim, restoring the pristine file between each.
obs The compiler named a shadow again, and again it was right: the parameter standing collided with the file-scope standing that reads a table's seated phases. Renamed to record rather than left as one word meaning two things inside one module.
obs The rung below's own loss reads zero here, and that is the finding rather than a gap: a plan that listened and could not accept what it heard has still listened, so the harm moves up a tier into the record this rung keeps.
obs The fifth RED is the one worth naming. With every guard disarmed and an agreeing reader in the box, the run wrote cc into its own record -- a reader who agreed, written down as disputing themselves. Seeing that once is what makes founded a check rather than decoration.
obs Registered the rung in the choir in the same round, per REDS %81's lesson. The Caravan choir now sings 63 per-rung witnesses in one voice, roster bijection whole.
obs Synced the README module table while it was open -- amend, courier, and hear had never been added as rows, and dispute joins them rather than landing alone above three gaps.
loom witness=caravan_dispute_witness phases=6 dependents=6 recorded=1 unrecorded_before=1 unrecorded_after=0 reds_proven=5 choir_rungs=63
