file tools/caravan_dispute_witness.rish the witness -- one plan run twice, the record parting the two standings, every note read outside the run that wrote it
file tools/caravan_suite_witness.rish the choir registration, so the rung never sings unheard
file caravan/README.md the rung's own section, and the four module-table rows the arc had outgrown
file crux/REMEMBER.md the live edge, refilled with what is next
recommend keep-going the arc has answered for reach at every moment of a dependent's life, repaired what a fall cost, taken back its own stale judgments, written to the reader those judgments misled, carried that letter to where the reader is, read what they answered, and now keeps their disagreement in the record -- so the question standing above it is what a plan owes a disagreement that stays open: the record holds two readings and resolves neither, which is honest and leaves the next run to meet a quarrel it did not start and cannot yet weigh.
